  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter or margarine, melted",
    "24 eggs",
    "2.25 teaspoons salt",
    "2.5 cups milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7QdsXnt-a1pyyQH-7VncYz1nxJ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-57459-oven-scrambled-eggs-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-deba9dcb7b7e4e36a67e155f5ed0e2c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57459/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour melted butter into a 9x13-inch glass baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oeGiqOy9MhPB2cPZ-sSP4qBeD80=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-57459-oven-scrambled-eggs-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-eb9829828f8c4ed2b3c61b8973b48adc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57459/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs and salt together in a large bowl until well blended. Gradually whisk in milk. Pour egg mixture into the buttered dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aMw4cvjCFmOiwRKXB18k0ZlczYY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-57459-oven-scrambled-eggs-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-3d43fc4946074e50b4934d2ca0ca7ff1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57459/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake uncovered in the preheated oven for 10 to 15 minutes. Stir egg mixture and continue to bake about 10 minutes more; stir again. Continue to bake until until eggs are just set and no longer runny, about 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
